    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21400" root="سيخ" body-key="s">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَاخَ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَسِيخُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَيْخٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَيَخَانٌ</span>,
<i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَسَخَ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَاخَ</span> [both app. as signifying <i>It sank
into the ground:</i> or by the former may here be
meant <i>it was,</i> or <i>became, firm, steady, steadfast,
stable, fixed, fast, settled,</i> or <i>established</i>]. (K.)
See also 1 in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سوخ</span>, in two places.

